  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">I4Policy Start-up training follow up</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is an add on to project PCB23TZ02.The aim of this project is to contribute to the Netherlands embassy in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania&apos;s ongoing initiative to support the enabling environment for startups in Tanzania.In light of the recent appointment of the Steering Committee for the Startup Act Roadmap, this project presents an opportunity to assist ecosystem leaders and policymakers in successfully implementing the Startup Act. Through these social events, the Netherlands embassy in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania wishes to bring together important stakeholders of the startup ecosystem to create momentum for the policy implementation process of the Startup Act.</narrative>
  </description>
